    {
      "occurrenceId": "07ff221d6d0bcc794eeda50cb4370212dc29eeeccc952fb6e0c5d30649a2904e",
      "source": "docs/planning/campaign3-procrastination-model-rev1/preserved/docs/formal/PROCRASTINATION_PUBLIC_CONTRACT.md",
      "sourceSha256": "fd58fa8e1a319d797bfcd9bde4e078dd1ff36ee7f116f1b8a1726cbfdd92c844",
      "location": {
        "startLine": 1,
        "endLine": 1
      },
      "text": "# Bounded postponement under a retained goal\r\n",
      "category": "NARRATIVE"
    },
    {
      "occurrenceId": "73950bcd1b1eea8d46216409e964c2a6a35d423314646f0a3473f658b52005a5",
      "source": "docs/planning/campaign3-procrastination-model-rev1/preserved/docs/formal/PROCRASTINATION_PUBLIC_CONTRACT.md",
      "sourceSha256": "fd58fa8e1a319d797bfcd9bde4e078dd1ff36ee7f116f1b8a1726cbfdd92c844",
      "location": {
        "startLine": 3,
        "endLine": 6
      },
      "text": "Version procrastination-public/0.1-candidate. ACCEPTED before implementation,\r\n2026-09-25. LOCAL DISPOSITION — no owner ruling required. Architecture11.1–11.4\r\nalready admits goal horizon, competing immediate reward and prospective pressure;\r\n12 preserves exact reasons/dice. No global procrastination trait or utility roulette.\r\n",
      "category": "NARRATIVE"
    },
    {
      "occurrenceId": "4c84bda3b7d032610cbe0ed65f8c4f4493abbed86a95dcf394e4733d6108c679",
      "source": "docs/planning/campaign3-procrastination-model-rev1/preserved/docs/formal/PROCRASTINATION_PUBLIC_CONTRACT.md",
      "sourceSha256": "fd58fa8e1a319d797bfcd9bde4e078dd1ff36ee7f116f1b8a1726cbfdd92c844",
      "location": {
        "startLine": 8,
        "endLine": 21
      },
      "text": "## Goal and independent motives\r\nOne actor, a work task requiring three observed successful work units by instant6,\r\nand a separate immutable adopted immediate-activity task. Content1374 commits both\r\nconcrete task371 identities, work/defer action definitions, deadline6 and required3.\r\nWork goal1356 initially inactive/status0/progress0; immediate task adopted=true.\r\nInstruction1 at140 adopts work once;2 cancels an active goal. Status1Active,\r\n2PerceivedFulfilled,3Cancelled,4DeadlineMissed are distinct; terminal status never\r\nreactivates. Active goal receives one progress unit only from this instant's admitted\r\nperformed-work observation with positive outcome; no observation reuse. At140,\r\ncompletion has priority over deadline failure at instant6. This is perceived progress,\r\nnot hidden world synchronization. Actual performed units remain separately traceable.\r\nCancellation is explicit, not a synonym for choosing defer. Future opportunity and\r\ncurrent task progress have separate roots/owners. Immediate activity is a finite\r\ninitial experimental adoption, not a physiological Need or immortal general desire.\r\n",
      "category": "NARRATIVE"
    },
    {
      "occurrenceId": "1574039f43b458756d9497aefa9fc3d9015cf141477edaad0bf01670af2d08c9",
      "source": "docs/planning/campaign3-procrastination-model-rev1/preserved/docs/formal/PROCRASTINATION_PUBLIC_CONTRACT.md",
      "sourceSha256": "fd58fa8e1a319d797bfcd9bde4e078dd1ff36ee7f116f1b8a1726cbfdd92c844",
      "location": {
        "startLine": 23,
        "endLine": 34
      },
      "text": "## Source, access and physical execution\r\nOriginal1355 embeds inherited818 (time, mode, positive-unit truth, execution visibility,\r\nunit display0authentic/1positive/2negative, perceived-current-feasibility cue).\r\nAll originals must use mode2: this profile has no instructed-action/training shortcut.\r\nRemaining fields: work instruction0..2, reminder, maintenance support, immediate\r\nactivity availability, board visibility, future report0none/1unavailable/2available,\r\nreport visibility, recipient, actual current feasibility and execution block.\r\nCurrent feasibility/reminder/immediate availability are gated by the visible board;\r\nthese controlled signals can disagree with physical feasibility. Maintained access\r\nuses the existing goal-reminder/support law. Work is an option only when active,\r\nmaintained and perceived currently feasible. Defer is always a fallback option.\r\nFailure of access or current feasibility is explicitly NOT called procrastination.\r\n",
      "category": "NARRATIVE"
    },
    {
      "occurrenceId": "525d5567f115ec34656160123102b9f2583f35fdd7edbfc23b579cb71fd0630e",
      "source": "docs/planning/campaign3-procrastination-model-rev1/preserved/docs/formal/PROCRASTINATION_PUBLIC_CONTRACT.md",
      "sourceSha256": "fd58fa8e1a319d797bfcd9bde4e078dd1ff36ee7f116f1b8a1726cbfdd92c844",
      "location": {
        "startLine": 36,
        "endLine": 42
      },
      "text": "Future report refers to one fixed opportunity at instant6. Observation120 admits it\r\nonly when nonzero, visible and addressed. Record1370 stores its optional Boolean;\r\n1371 retains ordered immutable observations under root1372/authority/prospective-evidence,\r\nwritten only at forecast140. Unknown differs from reported unavailable. Latest report\r\npersists across missing evidence; it never supplies physical future knowledge.\r\nA report received at120/140 affects next40 only. Reports can be wrong and corrected.\r\nAfter instant6 they are retained history, not a still-future opportunity.\r\n",
      "category": "NARRATIVE"
    },
    {
      "occurrenceId": "02d06ee76e23801207a621884d96090fd899479f654ae51c4a363aa048ab8cd1",
      "source": "docs/planning/campaign3-procrastination-model-rev1/preserved/docs/formal/PROCRASTINATION_PUBLIC_CONTRACT.md",
      "sourceSha256": "fd58fa8e1a319d797bfcd9bde4e078dd1ff36ee7f116f1b8a1726cbfdd92c844",
      "location": {
        "startLine": 44,
        "endLine": 48
      },
      "text": "Actual execution110 performs a work unit iff chosen work AND actual feasible AND not\r\nblocked. Positive-unit truth is independent of choice. Observation120 sees performed\r\nwork and authentic or misleading positive result only when execution is visible.\r\nNeither intended work nor a future report supplies progress. Hidden failed/completed\r\nunits never silently change perceived fulfillment. Goal140 consumes safe observations.\r\n",
      "category": "NARRATIVE"
    },
    {
      "occurrenceId": "f6e383b005c5ada36f7af0d8c78e7bd9de86c6c6559e550982f0fa0cb026aeff",
      "source": "docs/planning/campaign3-procrastination-model-rev1/preserved/docs/formal/PROCRASTINATION_PUBLIC_CONTRACT.md",
      "sourceSha256": "fd58fa8e1a319d797bfcd9bde4e078dd1ff36ee7f116f1b8a1726cbfdd92c844",
      "location": {
        "startLine": 50,
        "endLine": 56
      },
      "text": "## Exact candidate valuation and choices\r\nForecastRelative1: accessible work value1/4 iff latest future report is available\r\nAND currentAt<6; otherwise1. NoTemporalBias2: always1. PresentFocused3: always1/4,\r\neven when the later report is unknown/unavailable or the deadline arrives.\r\nNoImmediateMotive4 uses ForecastRelative work value but omits the immediate ground.\r\nThese are bounded valuations, not a universal temporal discount law or calibrated\r\nexchange rate. They preserve independent source identities and do not erase desire.\r\n",
      "category": "NARRATIVE"
    },
    {
      "occurrenceId": "45fedf10f378d26d3060adc806400060f4215eb47e523937c2a45b9cde606f78",
      "source": "docs/planning/campaign3-procrastination-model-rev1/preserved/docs/formal/PROCRASTINATION_PUBLIC_CONTRACT.md",
      "sourceSha256": "fd58fa8e1a319d797bfcd9bde4e078dd1ff36ee7f116f1b8a1726cbfdd92c844",
      "location": {
        "startLine": 58,
        "endLine": 66
      },
      "text": "When work is an admitted option, its actual raw work-task ground has that strictly\r\npositive value. If the separate immediate task is adopted and the activity is\r\nvisibly available, defer receives a distinct raw immediate-task ground of value1,\r\nexcept NoImmediateMotive. No separate habitual inhibition, fatigue or rumination\r\nlaw is active. Source roles/compileReasonNuclei/exact arbitration and addressed dice\r\nremain inherited. No new random grammar. Reasons51/52 → decision60 → intent70 →\r\nfrozen expression80 → plan90 → attempt100 → execution110. Deferral is counted as\r\npostponement only while the work goal is active, accessible, currently feasible,\r\nand represented by a positive work reason. Idle without those conditions is not proof.\r\n",
      "category": "NARRATIVE"
    },
    {
      "occurrenceId": "e11d00aa8dd9560366a39bed9b52b20b4fedbd20e75ee08577687fbe29633662",
      "source": "docs/planning/campaign3-procrastination-model-rev1/preserved/docs/formal/PROCRASTINATION_PUBLIC_CONTRACT.md",
      "sourceSha256": "fd58fa8e1a319d797bfcd9bde4e078dd1ff36ee7f116f1b8a1726cbfdd92c844",
      "location": {
        "startLine": 68,
        "endLine": 79
      },
      "text": "## Ownership, codecs and conservation\r\nRecords1353..1373 adapt the transactional CONTROL/FATIGUE scaffold;1374content,\r\n1375appraisal and1376options give work valuation its own typed grammar rather than\r\nreinterpreting inherited habit strength. Namespace1155 is reused; no new namespace.\r\nAll schema1; allocation table authoritative. At most8 originals at increasing integer\r\ninstants1..8. Fifteen stages, with forecast140 replacing fatigue140. appraise40 reads\r\ngoal/workspace/forecast plus inherited outcome diagnostics. Workspace writes40;\r\ngoal140 writes only goal; forecast140 only its journal. Fixed observation reservations,\r\nprivate original/child associations, actual read domains, canonical codec, transactional\r\nrollback, whole-prefix restore and data-only frozen-model allowlist remain required.\r\nThe inherited history/reward leaves are diagnostic observation folds only, never\r\ninputs to feasibility or work valuation. They do not turn procrastination into habit.\r\n",
      "category": "NARRATIVE"
    },
    {
      "occurrenceId": "1bd66e8e25b08c0c28e2a8194d60cc8e934d3ce505536dc75ec3362c1fa64bcb",
      "source": "docs/planning/campaign3-procrastination-model-rev1/preserved/docs/formal/PROCRASTINATION_PUBLIC_CONTRACT.md",
      "sourceSha256": "fd58fa8e1a319d797bfcd9bde4e078dd1ff36ee7f116f1b8a1726cbfdd92c844",
      "location": {
        "startLine": 81,
        "endLine": 85
      },
      "text": "Observer views admit safe evaluations/options/reasons/intent/expression/observations\r\nand goal/forecast updates; original and execution truth remain excluded. Require\r\nwhole-view equality under hidden physical/unit changes with equal admitted evidence,\r\nincluding denied forecasts and later common receiving. Freeze unique run identities\r\nand exact model/run/experiment/comparison identities before public qualification.\r\n",
      "category": "NARRATIVE"
    },
    {
      "occurrenceId": "55887587a4e73f8699a903394b40ab89aa4d49d94db558db4506ead9eb714797",
      "source": "docs/planning/campaign3-procrastination-model-rev1/preserved/docs/formal/PROCRASTINATION_PUBLIC_CONTRACT.md",
      "sourceSha256": "fd58fa8e1a319d797bfcd9bde4e078dd1ff36ee7f116f1b8a1726cbfdd92c844",
      "location": {
        "startLine": 87,
        "endLine": 94
      },
      "text": "MEC004/P3-001/006/009 preserve controlled fallible evidence, not natural recognition.\r\nMEC012..017/019/022 port independent task grounds, exact dice, frozen meaning and\r\nattempt/outcome. MEC018 identity remains separately preserved, not updated here.\r\nMEC020/EXP013 preserve active-only pressure, concrete lifecycle and terminality.\r\nMEC011/EXP003/004 preserve feasibility/access distinction; old habit/control remain\r\nseparate controls. P3-012 preserves procrastination phenomenon, not old mechanisms.\r\nRO012/014/019/020 retain broader prospective valuation, lifecycle, source and integration\r\nlimits;021 historical reconciliation mandatory. No architecture reduction.\r\n",
      "category": "NARRATIVE"
    },
    {
      "occurrenceId": "f61baf971784cf3a0cf04a9b52f0fc097e3b818877fb76bd70fff15417a37bac",
      "source": "docs/planning/campaign3-procrastination-model-rev1/preserved/docs/formal/PROCRASTINATION_PUBLIC_CONTRACT.md",
      "sourceSha256": "fd58fa8e1a319d797bfcd9bde4e078dd1ff36ee7f116f1b8a1726cbfdd92c844",
      "location": {
        "startLine": 96,
        "endLine": 102
      },
      "text": "Predeclare accessible feasible goal with actual defer choice and later work/consequence;\r\npositive independent raw reasons; no-bias/present-focused/no-immediate comparators;\r\nunknown/unavailable/wrong/corrected future reports; missing access versus inability;\r\nprogress/fulfillment/cancellation/deadline separation; hidden/denied whole views;\r\nall-stage rollback, ingress/authority negatives and all-prefix replay. This qualifies\r\nbounded postponement under retained desire, not irrationality, moral failure, clinical\r\nprocrastination, universal impatience or all short/long-term goal conflicts.\r\n",
      "category": "NARRATIVE"
    }
  ],
